  "caveats": [
    "Channel and CC-learn settings on the instrument can override the defaults.",
    "Tone, resonance, and envelope behavior depends on the selected synth engine.",
    "Successful MIDI transmission is not a device parameter acknowledgement.",
    "SLOOP's protocol documentation says 50 bytes after op; the serializer and upstream tests emit 50 including op.",
    "SLOOP's INFO name is FELUCCA SLOOP plus the release, not the USB port name.",
    "X0X's EDITOR_PROTOCOL.md is inherited; executable handlers take precedence.",
    "Melodee and Skiff need external clock pulses for their incoming realtime transport; this project does not generate clock."
  ]
